# The dashboard is a separate project (Rose-Intelligence/cf-dashboard). It is
# convenient to check it out here while working on both, and it must never be
# committed into this repository — an accidental `git add` would record it as a
# gitlink, which is worse than a stray directory.
cf-dashboard/

# Local agent/editor state
.claude/

# Internal specification and commercial documents. The public-facing design
# lives in docs/; the source specification carries strategy, economics and
# competitor analysis that does not belong in a code repository.
*.docx
*.pdf
*.xlsx

# Never commit these
*.pem
*.key
.env
